{"schema_version":"P12_ART9_114_MINGYI_FINAL28_EXACT_SOURCE_V1","source_paper_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008","source_school":"花蓮縣花蓮市明義國民小學","source_title":"114_康軒_四上_自然_期末評量卷_明義國小.pdf","original_pdf_sha256":"023ccfc808efbff873545efeae9b70ef4ce90ff3f5b55b1f94edcc81ca831fdd","original_pdf_pages":3,"original_raw_pdf_size_bytes":350499,"original_source_drive_file_id":"1pwlIRa40MeeVMlAYAyhufNchGEqbL6oT","original_full_paper_answer_positions_frozen":50,"original_full_paper_scored_points_frozen":100,"source_archived_count":28,"true_false":15,"four_option_choice":13,"original_mc_option_entries":52,"original_question_records":[{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|001","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"不論是講話的聲音，或是在戶外打籃球的聲音，我們聽得到的聲音都是因為物體振動所產生的。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,122.87,98.18,138.41]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|002","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"大樓的玻璃帷幕表面光亮，可以產生像鏡子一樣的反射現象。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,177.47,98.18,193.01]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|003","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"光照到物體所形成的影子形狀和物體的形狀大致相同。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,232.07,98.18,247.61]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|004","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"用手電筒照射物體，影子會在物體的後面。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,286.79,98.18,302.33]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|005","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"警察車警鈴是應用聲音的裝置，演唱會的燈光則是應用光的裝置，兩者都有達到警示效果的功能。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,321.23,98.18,336.77]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|006","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"如果有機會去到外太空，可以很清楚聽到爆炸的聲響。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,419.06,98.18,434.6]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|007","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"聲音不管是用空氣傳播、液體傳播還是固體傳播，聽起來都是一樣的。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,477.02,98.18,492.56]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|008","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"正確的通路可以使小馬達轉動，而且不管怎麼接，小馬達轉動的方向都會相同。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,531.74,98.18,547.28]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|009","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"為了方便起見，就算不常使用的電器，乾電池也不需要拿出來，不會有任何影響。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,593.54,98.18,609.08]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|010","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"有些燈飾上有許多小燈泡，當這些燈泡採用並聯方式連接時，如果有一顆燈泡不亮，其他的燈泡還是會亮。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,651.52,98.18,667.06]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|011","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"延長線可以同時連接多種電器，連接的數量沒有任何限制，越多越方便。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,733.48,98.18,749.02]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|012","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"電池有兩極，凸起的一端稱為負極，用「－」表示；平的一端稱為正極，用「＋」表示。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,788.2,98.18,803.74]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|013","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"在通路中，增加燈泡串聯的數量會讓燈泡變得更亮。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,842.8,98.18,858.34]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|014","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"因為迴紋針和鋁箔紙都可以導電，所以能夠用來製作簡易開關。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,897.43,98.18,912.97]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S01|TF|015","question_type":"TRUE_FALSE","full_original_stem":"如果對電器用品很好奇，想要了解各種電器使用的電池或電力來源，可以自行任意拆解電器來觀察實驗。","full_original_options_in_order":[],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[53.88,952.03,98.18,967.57]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|001","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"水上芭蕾舞者在水中可以聽到音樂播放的聲音，是因為聲音透過什麼來傳播？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"空氣"},{"label":"②","text":"水"},{"label":"③","text":"音響"},{"label":"④","text":"桌子。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[52.32,1068.07,96.53,1083.61]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|002","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"如果利用敲擊紙盒的方式來觀察聲音的大小，可能會觀察到下列哪一項實驗結果？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"敲擊紙盒用的力氣大小不同，發出的聲音大小也不同"},{"label":"②","text":"敲擊紙盒振動的大小與發出的聲音大小無關"},{"label":"③","text":"敲擊紙盒振動大，發出的聲音較小"},{"label":"④","text":"敲擊紙盒振動小，發出的聲音較大。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[455.59,104.87,499.87,120.41]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|003","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"下列有關光的敘述，哪一項不正確？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"光具有直線行進的特性"},{"label":"②","text":"本身能發光的物體，稱為光源"},{"label":"③","text":"光照射到鏡子時會改變行進方向，是利用光的直線行進特性"},{"label":"④","text":"從汽車後視鏡能看後方的路況，是屬於光的反射應用。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[455.59,296.15,499.8,311.69]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|004","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"跨年活動剛結束，在跨越新的一年時，各地幾乎都會放煙火來慶祝，以迎接新的一年。而煙火是應用聲與光的例子之一，下列哪一個物品或活動的功能和「煙火」是相同的？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"腳踏車車鈴"},{"label":"②","text":"燈塔"},{"label":"③","text":"紅綠燈"},{"label":"④","text":"花蓮鯉魚潭水舞光影秀。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[456.67,494.54,500.88,510.08]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|005","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"依照光的反射原理，如果找不到鏡子，下列哪一項物品最不適合用來替代鏡子？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"筆記本"},{"label":"②","text":"平靜的湖面"},{"label":"③","text":"不鏽鋼杯"},{"label":"④","text":"手機螢幕。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[456.67,690.16,500.88,705.7]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|006","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"將一個娃娃放在兩面鏡子之間，能看到好多個娃娃的影像，這主要是屬於下列哪一項應用？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"聲音藉由固體傳播"},{"label":"②","text":"聲音藉由液體傳播"},{"label":"③","text":"光是直線行進的"},{"label":"④","text":"鏡子會反射光線。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[456.67,813.4,500.88,828.94]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|007","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"在下列哪一個地方比較無法看見物體的影子？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"完全沒有燈光的深山裡"},{"label":"②","text":"燈光明亮的教室"},{"label":"③","text":"夜晚路燈下的街道"},{"label":"④","text":"白天的籃球場。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":1,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[456.67,922.75,500.88,938.29]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|010","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"若電路都連接正確，但燈泡卻不會亮，最不可能是什麼原因呢？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"沒有使用電池座"},{"label":"②","text":"電線接觸不良"},{"label":"③","text":"燈泡壞了"},{"label":"④","text":"電池沒電"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":2,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[52.32,225.47,96.53,241.01]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|011","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"用三個燈泡與三顆電池連接成通路後，將第二個燈泡從燈泡座中拔掉，發現另一個燈泡還是會亮，從以上敘述能確定的連接方式是哪一種？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"電池串聯"},{"label":"②","text":"電池並聯"},{"label":"③","text":"燈泡串聯"},{"label":"④","text":"燈泡並聯。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":2,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[52.32,421.1,96.53,436.64]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|012","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"同樣一顆電池，在下列哪個電路中，燈泡的亮度最暗？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"串聯3顆燈泡"},{"label":"②","text":"並聯2顆燈泡"},{"label":"③","text":"並聯4顆燈泡"},{"label":"④","text":"串聯2顆燈泡。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":2,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[52.32,616.72,96.62,632.26]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|013","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"下列哪一項物品或電器內通常都會有小馬達裝置？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"手電筒"},{"label":"②","text":"電動玩具車"},{"label":"③","text":"指北針"},{"label":"④","text":"電燈。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":2,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[52.32,747.16,96.53,762.7]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|014","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"增加小型電風扇的電池數量，並用串聯的方式連接時，會有什麼好處？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"使風扇轉得更快"},{"label":"②","text":"讓電力持久"},{"label":"③","text":"延長小型電風扇的使用期限"},{"label":"④","text":"方便觀察風扇葉片轉動的方向。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":2,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[52.32,845.92,96.53,861.46]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_008|S02|MC|015","question_type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","full_original_stem":"下列關於用電安全的敘述，哪一項是正確的？","full_original_options_in_order":[{"label":"①","text":"隨時檢查電線的塑膠皮是否完整"},{"label":"②","text":"使用電器時，電線捲在一起才可以省空間"},{"label":"③","text":"可以直接用潮溼的手碰觸插座"},{"label":"④","text":"使用電器時，插頭不需要插好，可以用就好。"}],"answer_marker_pdf_page":2,"answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left":[52.32,1007.95,96.53,1023.49]}]}
